OL,3,ATax thresholds remain unchanged -
OL,4,Ahere's what it means for your pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FIncome tax thresholds, which have been
OL,7,Ffrozen under successive chancellors,
OL,8,Fwill stay at current levels until April
OL,9,F2031 as planned. But after that they
OL,10,Fare expected to start to rise again
OL,11,Fwith inflation.
OL,13,FJohn Healey may not have mentioned the
OL,14,Fend of this policy in his Budget speech
OL,15,F- after all, it is still some way off -
OL,16,Fbut according to the documents released
OL,17,Fby the Office for Budget Responsibility
OL,18,F(OBR) the freeze, which has been
OL,19,Fshaving additional tax off people's
OL,20,Ftake-home pay for the past five years,
OL,21,Fis scheduled to end.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
